# REHMAN GWS — PRIVATE LEAD OPERATIONS CRM
## Production-Grade Master Build Specification

You are acting as a senior SaaS architect, senior full-stack engineer, Firebase architect, database engineer, UI/UX designer, mapping/GIS engineer, security engineer, QA engineer, and automation engineer.

Your task is to BUILD, TEST, DEBUG, and COMPLETE a production-quality private CRM for:

# REHMAN GWS

This is not a public SaaS product.

It is a PRIVATE ADMIN LEAD OPERATIONS SYSTEM designed primarily for one administrator, while keeping the architecture future-ready for additional authorized staff accounts.

The application must function as the daily operating system for lead generation, lead management, follow-ups, sales activity, geographic lead research, and daily productivity.

The central philosophy is:

"Open CRM → Immediately see what matters → Work the highest-priority lead → Record the action → CRM remembers everything → CRM determines what should happen next."

